description=每批使用一整袋沙或泥土，或一份黏土，加任意容器的0.1升水，制作5个原版饵托。支持净水、污水及两者混合水；满袋消耗后保留空袋，水容器保留。沿用原版饵托学习和加料机制。支持 B42.21 和 B42.22 单人版。 | Uses a full sand or dirt bag, or one clay, and 0.1 L of clean or tainted water to make five vanilla chum. Returns an empty bag, keeps the water container and preserves vanilla recipe knowledge. Supports single-player B42.21 and B42.22.
